Scope
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains a written architecture write-up and its diagram, derived
from a private BoB deployment. It describes a design. It does not contain the BoB
source code, credentials, tenant data, or any client material.

Claude Code (CLAUDE.md / auto memory) and OpenAI Codex (AGENTS.md) are named for
comparison only. They are third-party products, not included here, and each
remains under its own vendor terms and license.
